        ^"History" STRING "Cody went to jail for assaulting a school resource officer during an altercation at his high school in Atlanta.\n\nWas tried and convicted as an adult. Currently in violation of parole.\n\nHe has managed to avoid getting outed as a mutant so far."
        ^"Personality" STRING "Aggressive, unfocused, impulsive, resentful of the state.\n\nGoal: Is seeking to shake off the restrictions and constraints that has hampered him.\n\nBarrier: Cody is in denial that mere “freedom from” is sufficient. His goal is purely reductive right now, but he lacks a positive vision of the future, for himself or for others."
        ^"Biography Sections" LIST OF #mmrpgBioSection000000 ^"Biography Section" [
